   "is_fault_free": false,
   "t_start": "2038-05-10T06:00:00+00:00",
   "t_end": "2038-09-07T06:00:00+00:00",
   "notes": "HELD OUT. The tower fill fouls, so it can no longer cool the condenser water close to the wet bulb temperature. The chillers then face warmer condenser water and lose efficiency and capacity, which is a fault that shows up on one machine and is caused by another. NO RULE IS WRITTEN FOR THIS FAULT. It exists to test whether the system generalises to a degradation it has never been taught, rather than only recognising the ones it was tuned on."
  }
